    <paragraph>Estimate Square Roots</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, estimate each square root between two consecutive whole numbers.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="21" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\sqrt{70}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$8 &lt; 70 &lt; 9 8 &lt; 70 &lt; 9$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="22" has_solution="false">
